     Design note. No group is assigned to any menu. The Many2many field
     linking ir.ui.menu to res.groups is reported to have been renamed from
     groups_id to group_ids in Odoo 19, and this could not be confirmed from
     official Odoo 19 documentation; writing the wrong field name would make
     the module fail to install. Menu visibility therefore follows from the
     access control list: Odoo hides a menu whose action targets a model the
     user cannot read, and hides a parent menu with no visible child. The
     administrator guide records the one-line change to add explicit menu
     groups once the field name is confirmed on the target server. -->
<odoo>

    <menuitem id="menu_ls_cosmetics_root"
              name="Cosmetics"
              sequence="76"
              web_icon="ls_cosmetics,static/description/icon.png"/>

